    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "번개 구름이 하늘을 뒤덮으면\n나타난다. 갈기로 번개를\n붙잡아 전기를 모은다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il apparaît quand le ciel est à l’orage. Il capte les\néclairs avec sa crinière et accumule de l’électricité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es erscheint, wenn Gewitterwolken den Himmel\nverdunkeln. Es fängt mit seiner Mähne Blitze\nund hortet ihre Energie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aparece cuando nubes envueltas en rayos encapotan\nel cielo. Atrapa rayos con su crin y almacena\nelectricidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Appare quando il cielo si riempie di fulmini e saette.\nAccumula elettricità attirando i fulmini con la criniera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When thunderclouds cover the sky, it will appear.\nIt can catch lightning with its mane and store\nthe electricity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雷雲で　空が　覆われると\n現れる。たてがみで　雷を\nキャッチして　電気を　ためる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aparece cuando nubes envueltas en rayos encapotan\nel cielo. Atrapa rayos con su crin y almacena\nelectricidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほうでんすると　たてがみが　ひかる。\nたてがみが　かがやく　かいすうや\nリズムで　なかまと　かいわしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "방전하면 갈기가 빛난다.\n갈기가 빛나는 횟수나\n리듬으로 동료와 대화한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa crinière luit quand il lâche des décharges.\nIl module leur rythme et leur nombre pour\ncommuniquer avec ses pairs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Um mit Artgenossen zu kommunizieren, nutzt es\ndas Aufblitzen seiner Mähne beim Entladen von\nStrom als Morsecode.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su crin brilla cuando emite una descarga eléctrica.\nSe comunica con los suyos mediante el ritmo y el\nnúmero de brillos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
